	hed prior to entry. Bags that are not clear will be subject to additional 
	search.\nDoors: 6:30 PM Show: 8:00 PM Ages: All Ages **All support acts ar
	e subject to change without notice** To reduce staff contact with guest be
	longings\, we have implemented the following bag policy: Bags up to 12" x 
	6" x 12" are allowed in the venue. All bags will be searched prior to entr
	y. Bags that are not clear will be subject to additional search. Freya Sky
	e is contributing $1 per ticket sold to PLUS1\, a 501(c)(3)\, to benefit A
	ctive Minds in mobilizing youth and young adults to lead a transformative 
	movement in mental health\, forever changing how it is valued and prioriti
	zed in society. No portion of the ticket purchase is tax deductible. Pleas
	e see www.plus1.org for more information\n\nhttps://www.ticketmaster.com/f
